Note: Self-contained avatar. The brand logo ships white for the dark site header; it is placed on the Tails brand-purple (#56347c) rounded badge (as in the tails.net header) so it renders on both light and dark backgrounds instead of white-on-white. Inkscape/Sodipodi editor metadata stripped.

